                                                "sense_id": "46ba393b-2206-3468-b513-08269ce9639f",
                                                "text": "It is a rare sunny afternoon in an epically miserable London June when the wide South Bank plaza area along the Thames near Waterloo Bridge begins filling with bicycle riders."
                                            },
